WEBVTT

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.936
It isn't a neat, symmetrical
Valentine's heart.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.094
It's bodily, it's systemic,

00:11:03.118 --> 00:11:08.114
it is a hideous pair of ram's horns
buried somewhere deep within your skull,

00:11:08.138 --> 00:11:10.458
and when that special boy walks by,

00:11:10.482 --> 00:11:11.911
it lights up,

00:11:11.935 --> 00:11:14.861
and if he likes you back
and you make each other happy,

00:11:14.885 --> 00:11:16.504
then you fan the flames.

00:11:16.528 --> 00:11:17.950
And if he doesn't,

00:11:17.974 --> 00:11:20.025
then you assemble a team
of neuroscientists

00:11:20.049 --> 00:11:21.683
to snuff them out by force.

00:11:21.707 --> 00:11:23.617
(Laughter)

00:11:23.641 --> 00:11:24.876
Thanks.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.405
(Applause)